# 41. Failure Handling

## Unable to reproduce

Status:

```text
INCONCLUSIVE
```

The system should identify missing information.

Example:

```text
Unable to reproduce.

Needed:
- production request payload
- database isolation level
- timing between the two requests
```

---

## Insufficient context

Status:

```text
NEEDS_MORE_CONTEXT
```

The Jira ticket can receive a clarification comment.

---

## All hypotheses fail

Do not fabricate a diagnosis.

Return:

```text
No hypothesis was sufficiently supported by evidence.
```

---

## Tests cannot run

Mark:

```text
BLOCKED
```

Include environment problem.

