# 47. Acceptance Criteria

The hackathon prototype is complete when:

- a Jira bug can be imported;
- the system launches at least three independent investigation agents;
- each returns a distinct hypothesis;
- agents run concurrently;
- each hypothesis can be independently tested;
- at least one seeded bug can be reproduced;
- a regression test fails against the original implementation;
- the same regression test passes against the candidate fix;
- existing tests remain green;
- competing hypotheses are visibly rejected;
- an arbiter creates a diagnosis report;
- a user can inspect the evidence;
- human approval is required;
- a draft PR can be generated or convincingly demonstrated.

