# 49. Final Product Statement

TraceLab is an evidence-driven multi-agent debugging platform that investigates several root-cause hypotheses simultaneously, validates candidate fixes through reproducible regression tests, and presents engineers with a transparent diagnosis before any code is merged.

Its core workflow is:

```text
Bug
 ↓
Understand
 ↓
Generate competing hypotheses
 ↓
Investigate in parallel
 ↓
Reproduce
 ↓
Patch independently
 ↓
FAIL before / PASS after
 ↓
Compare evidence
 ↓
Human-reviewed diagnosis
 ↓
PR
```

The central innovation is not autonomous code generation.

It is **turning AI debugging from sequential guessing into parallel, testable scientific investigation.**